# HOW IT WORKS

Section heading:

# One product.

# One digital journey.

Create a visually impressive 6-step horizontal timeline.

### 01 — SOURCE

Farmer registers raw material.

Show:

`Origin • Farm • Crop • Quality`

### 02 — PROCESS

Material is transformed into a production batch.

Show:

`Batch ID • Transformation • Quality`

### 03 — MANUFACTURE

Final product receives a digital identity.

Show:

`Product ID • Batch • Unit`

### 04 — DISTRIBUTE

Transport and custody events are recorded.

Show:

`Location • Time • Custody`

### 05 — VERIFY

Consumer scans the QR.

Show:

`Trace • Authenticity • Origin`

### 06 — RESPOND

Consumer feedback becomes a risk signal.

Show:

`Complaint → Pattern → Escalation → Recall`

Use scroll-driven animations where the chain progressively builds.

